==Notes==
*Unlocking all main nodes at max rank on the Unairu school tree requires a grand total of '''15,505,000''' focus, broken down as follows:
**'''9,000,000''' Unairu focus points for the main tree
**'''1,500,000''' points and 2 {{Resource|Brilliant Eidolon Shard|Brilliant Eidolon Shards}} to unbind both Way-bound nodes
**'''5,005,000''' points, 159 {{Resource|Lyroic Bridge}}, 198 {{Resource|Ren Hypercore}}, and 166 {{Resource|Ascaris Prime}} to obtain and fully unlock Cogron Tauron Strike
***If a player has already spent the resources to obtain Cogron Tauron Strike a player would only need 9 {{Resource|Lyroic Bridge}}, 48 {{Resource|Ren Hypercore}}, and 16 {{Resource|Ascaris Prime}}, along with the same '''5,005,000''' points
*A fully levelled Unairu Operator is capable of:
**'''Way-Bound:''' On Warframe [[Bleedout]], activating Transference summons Operator, who has '''15''' seconds to kill enemies to fill a gauge to revive the Warframe; each kill fills the gauge by '''30%''' but gradually drains over time. In this state, Operator gains '''100%''' [[Amp]] damage plus an additional '''25%''' per second.
**'''Passive:''' Transference grants immunity to [[slow]], {{D|Stagger}}, and {{D|Knockdown}} for '''40''' seconds. Increases Warframe and Operator [[armor]] by '''200'''.
**'''Warframe Passive:''' When Operator is downed, pressing the interact button (default {{Keybind|X}}) summons the Warframe to their location, becoming invulnerable for '''4''' seconds. Killing an enemy while invulnerable has a '''100%''' chance to remove [[Transference Static]].
**'''First Ability:''' Creates an '''8''' meter field that lasts '''30''' seconds, removing all enemy [[shield]]s while they are inside it. [[Void Sling]]ing out of the field refreshes its duration and increases its radius by '''100%'''.
**'''Second Ability:''' Launches a bomb that explodes on impact or reactivation while mid-flight, creating an '''8''' meter explosion that permanently removes '''100%''' of enemy [[armor]]. Each enemy hit has a '''100%''' chance to summon an Unairu Wisp that seeks out the nearest ally in [[affinity]] range to boost Operator [[Amp]] damage by '''100%''' for '''20''' seconds.
**'''Cogron's''' pulses will have a greater range.
**'''Cogron''' will enable the user to partially strip enemies of their defenses with every hit.
**'''Cogron''' will release Universal Orbs and Ammo on every pulse, and can grant this ability to the next 4 Melee slam attacks of the user.
**'''Cogron''' will spawn motes that grant 450 bonus armor, with a maximum carry limit of 5.

